using StateSystem

~ homeless_greet
Homeless Person: 你做游戏有什么用？
- 给零钱
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 1.0, "hope_despair": 2})
	=> homeless_talk
- 停下倾听
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1, "will": 0.5})
	=> homeless_talk
- 快步走过
	=> homeless_ignore
- 坐下休息 [if StateSystem.hope_despair <= -4]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 0.5})
	=> homeless_low_will

~ homeless_talk
Homeless Person: Ten years on this bridge.\nGame makers, night workers, loners.\nYou all look the same at 2 AM.
- 「你以前做什么？」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1, "conviction": 0.5})
	=> homeless_story
- 「我得走了。」
	=> homeless_farewell

~ homeless_story
Homeless Person: I made things too.\nSmall things. Paper boats.\nThen I just stopped—like infinite potential sealed in finite form.
- 「为什么？」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 0.5})
	=> homeless_farewell
- 「…我懂。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1, "will": 0.5})
	=> homeless_farewell
- 「你为什么做游戏？」 [if StateSystem.hope_despair >= 2]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 1.0})
	=> homeless_deep_question

~ homeless_deep_question
Homeless Person: Why do you make games?\nAsk yourself that.\nThe infinite question meets a finite answer on this bridge.
- 「…也许吧。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"conviction": 0.5, "hope_despair": 1})
	=> homeless_farewell

~ homeless_farewell
Homeless Person: Keep making things.\nRain or no rain.\nThat's all any of us can do within our finite nights.
- 「谢谢。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2, "will": 1.0})
	do StateSystem.set_flag("heard_homeless_story", true)
	=> END

~ homeless_low_will
Narrator: You sit on wet concrete.\nThe city hums below.\nIt might be the same hum you heard in the office.
- Get up. Keep going.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": 1.0})
	=> homeless_farewell

~ homeless_ignore
Narrator: You walk past.\nTheir gaze follows you through the rain.\nThe question might echo forever.
- (Continue to the underpass)
	do StateSystem.set_flag("ignored_homeless", true)
	=> END
